=2 Walkthrough
* Make sure you have two slots available in active inventory.
* Speak with Regine to begin quest and choose the option to look for work.
* After her story, {i:Magicmart Flyer|Magicmart Flyer|532} x15 will given to you.
* While this quest is active, if you come close to an NPC you need to give a flyer to, a message will appear in /say informing you that "... looks over curiously for a moment."

:* What happens if you drop the fliers? You must hand out 15 fliers or the quest wont be completed. If you somehow lose the fliers, you may purchase additional fliers from Regine at the cost of 10gil per flier. Trade her 10gil each time to receive 1 flier, which is the max she will trade you at one time. You can also buy the fliers at the {z:Auction House}.

* Travel to the following zones and trade the fliers to the following NPCs:

:* {z:Port San d'Oria}

::* {n:Answald} (J-10) - front of Mog house
::* {n:Portaure} (H-9) - Cargo room B
::* {n:Miene} (I-9) - open area by water
::* {n:Prietta} (H-9) - up the stairs above cargo rooms
::* {n:Auvare} (H-6) - behind the Air Travel Agency

:* {z:Northern San d'Oria}

::* {n:Guilberdrier} (F-3) - front of Carpenter`s guild
::* {n:Villion} (F-3) - Carpenter`s guild, 2nd floor balcony
::* {n:Capiria} (F-6) - Near Laborman's Way arch, overlooking the sluice gates
::* {n:Boncort} (F-8) - Phoenix Perch Inn, 2nd floor
::* {n:Coullene} (M-6) - Cathedral

:* {z:Southern San d'Oria}

::* {n:Leuveret} (F-8) - Raimbroy's Grocery, 2nd floor balcony
::* {n:Blendare} (J-9) - under tree near Auction House
::* {n:Maugie} (L-9) - near Eastgate
::* {n:Adaunel} (K-9) - up the stairs on top of Eastgate archway
::* {n:Rosel} (K-8) - Rosel's Armour Shop

* Once all 15 {i:Magicmart Flyers|Magicmart Flyer|532} have been distributed, return to Regine and speak with her to end quest.

